<title>USA: Iomega launches recording software.</title>
<headline>Iomega launches recording software.</headline>
<dateline>ROY, Utah 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iomega Corp said it introduced RecordIt, digital recording software that enables audio recording and playback on personal computers with sound quality comparable to a CD.</p>
<p>The software allows a personal computer to capture both pre-recorded and live audio, which can be digitally saved to and used directly from a Zip disk, Jaz disk or hard drive.</p>
